CREATED:20230621T070227Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nCareer Jam\nSynopsis\n:\nDo you have questions on int
	ernal mobility? Join us as we hear from employees who have done internal m
	obility\, hiring managers and releasing managers to debunk some of the myt
	hs you may have!\nSpeaker\n:\nMatthew Eng Chye LEE\nElaine Leh Chin CHONG\
	nChun Meng TEE\nPremshila Shilpan JOSHI\nShivani SINGH\nModerator\n:\nWill
	iam Tanoto TAN\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n\nJoin via Laptop\n\n*A
	s a first time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this [​mp4
	 icon]  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4<https://dbs1bank-my.shar
	epoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0or
	dpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2> guide prior to the event. This will install We
	bex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming experience!
	\n\n  1.  On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events 
	URL<https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=ebba34ae8cf4954e99a384303
	1f5d5b75>\n  2.  Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and cli
	ck on [Join Now]\n\n\nJoin via Mobile Device\n\n  1.  Download Webex Meeti
	ngs App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & 
	Input Meeting Number: 2515 914 8254\n\n  1.  Input Password 1234\n\n\nJoin
	 via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-301
	8-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-
	6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2515 914 8254\nGlobal call-i
	n numbers<https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e1be1d7fb8cf19da
	df242f64798d49372>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
